From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] msxml3: The Schema Object Model (6053)

IXMLDOMSchemaCollection2::getSchema and getDeclaration gave E_NOTIMPL.
Programs that read an XSD's structure through MSXML (form designers, XML
editors, document generators) ask the schema cache for the schema of a
namespace and walk its declarations and types, or ask for the
declaration of an instance node.

New som.c reads the XSD document a cache entry keeps: ISchema, its
element, attribute, type, group and notation items, their collections,
and the XSD built-in datatypes; types give their base types, facets,
enumeration, whitespace and isValid, complex types their attributes and
content models; getDeclaration finds an instance element's declaration
through its ancestors' types. Every interface works through IDispatch.
---
