+/*
+ * The SOM objects read the schema document a schema cache keeps (the XSD,
+ * or the XSD an XDR schema was turned into): an item is an xs: element of
+ * it -- a declaration, a definition, a model group -- or one of the built-in
+ * datatypes. Names, types, scopes, facets and content models are found by
